{"reviewId": "35141733_80zUE2V7x", "review": {"abstract": "康波的形成是人的集体行为的结果，而这种集体行为取决于人的代际更迭。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "一代人有一代人的命运，八零后的这代人，在学校的二十年，经历了国家最繁荣的时光，经济的繁荣也带来了文化的百花齐放，也就是网友常说的音乐电影不负八零后。而差不多二十年后陆续毕业，赶上房地产黄金十年结束。开始慢慢感受到艰难，也差不多刚好成家立业的年纪，疫情，失业，学历贬值，考研潮，考公潮……所谓，时代的一粒灰尘就是人生的无数座大山。大概就是这个意思吧。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "953-986", "createTime": 1748760748, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "35141733_80zUE2V7x", "userVid": 35141733, "topics": [], "userEditTime": 1748761101, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 35141733, "name": "不二法师。", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTKexuZJbx6raplkrYS8dE466JUaSvmnDmROicC5ic7fj6Siaw7DNfsYtnsJ81AaswUVwhJrJiaKpOtIhA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-50", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 50}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 6, "likes": [{"userVid": 300629636, "name": "勇", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEKdkcichlWLUPauibNR0EBxqJibco70qGvogH3KyN4kbIkAL3GicmRj0l7cSLcj2CrKqvLhvjQ0qN4DYPLjhK1RxnticQiblq0Odcibdl3mfJBHmkTcQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13